WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[190308] = "Use: Tosses a torch at the target location, starting a fire."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[191204] = "Use: Turn 100 lesser deathstones into a greater one. (0 Secs Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[191267] = "Use: Transports you to the Antechamber in Naxxramas. (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[191268] = "Use: Crush the orb, increasing the amount of lesser deathstones absorbed from Kel'Thuzad's minions by 50% for 30 min. (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[191272] = "Use: Subdues the will of an undead target within Naxxramas, causing them to become charmed for 5 min. (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[191280] = "Use: Grants your offensive abilities a chance to summon a spore that affects nearby players with Fungal Bloom when killed. This effect lasts for 1 hour.\n\nFungal Bloom \nInflicts 150 Nature damage every 1 sec while increasing the chance for a melee, ranged, or spell critical by 15%. (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[191288] = "Use: Transports you to Frostwyrm's Lair in Naxxramas. (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[191292] = "Use: Absorb the life force of those around you, increasing stamina by 3 for each target hit. This effect stacks up to 40 and lasts for 1 hour. (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[191312] = "Equip: Prevents an attack that would otherwise kill you. Triggering this effect also grants you 3 sec of damage immunity and shatters the phylactery."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[191313] = "Use: Adopt the visage of a denizen of Naxxramas. (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[191414] = "Use: Entraps the soul of the dead target, granting you a beneficial effect. This effect lasts for 1 hour. (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[191459] = "Use: Empowers Kel'Thuzad and his lieutenants with necromantic energy, granting them increased health and damage. Empowered foes will yield additional rewards upon defeat.\n\nThis effect stacks and lasts for an entire week. (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[191477] = "Use: Summons a skeletal hitching post.\n\nParty members may use the post to acquire a Skeletal Steed.\n (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[191480] = "Use: Summons and dismisses a skeletal steed.  This steed is obedient to the summoner and can be used as a mount within Naxxramas.  Any hostile action towards the rider forces the steed to run away in fear.\n (3 Secs Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[191660] = "Use: Affix the bolts to your neck, applying a positive or negative charge at random that grants 1% increased damage and healing. \n\nThis effect stacks while near allies who have a similar charge, and deals Nature damage to allies who have an opposite charge. (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[191661] = "Use: Pierce yourself with the fang, increasing movement speed, attack speed, and cast speed by 15% for 1 hour. (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[202251] = "Use: Open the bag of treats and palm it into your target's pocket, increasing the damage of Beasts against this target by 20. (1 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[202254] = "Equip: Improves your chance to get a critical strike with spells by 1%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[202256] = "Equip: Gain the Quick Draw ability:\n\n\nDraw your ranged weapon and fire a quick shot at an enemy, causing normal ranged weapon damage and reducing the target's movement speed by 50% for 6 sec. Awards 1 combo point.\n\nQuick Draw benefits from all talents and effects that trigger from or modify Sinister Strike."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[202316] = "Use: Coats a weapon with poison that lasts for 30 minutes.\nEach strike has a 30% chance of poisoning the enemy, slowing their movement speed by 50% for 12 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[203745] = "Engrave your gloves with the Ice Lance rune:\n\n\nDeals 96 to 113 Frost damage to an enemy target.  Causes 400% damage against Frozen targets.\n\nWhen your other frost spells deal damage to a non-player controlled target, they increase the target's damage taken from your next Ice Lance by 20%.  This effect stacks up to 5 times and requires the Winter's Chill talent."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[203746] = "Engrave your pants with the Living Flame rune:\n\n\nSummons a spellfire flame that moves toward the target, leaving a trail of spellfire. This trail deals 181 Spellfire damage every second to nearby enemies. Lasts 10 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[203747] = "Engrave your chest or robe with the Fingers of Frost rune:\n\n\nGives your Chill effects a 25% chance to grant you the Fingers of Frost effect, which treats your next 2 spells cast as if the target were Frozen.  Lasts 15 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[203748] = "Engrave your chest with the Burnout rune:\n\n\nIncreases your spell critical strike chance with all spells by 15%, but your non-periodic spell critical strikes now have an additional mana cost of 1% of your base mana."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[203749] = "Engrave your chest or robe with the Enlightenment rune:\n\n\nYou deal 10% more damage while you have more than 70% mana. While below 30% mana 10% of your mana regeneration continues while casting."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[203750] = "Use: Dig up treasure at the marked location (1 Min Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[203751] = "Use: Decipher the spell notes with a Comphrehension Primer to learn a new Engraving spell."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[203752] = "Use: Decipher the spell notes with a Comprehension Charm to learn a new Engraving spell."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[203753] = "Use: Decipher the spell notes with a Comprehension Charm to learn a new Engraving spell."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[203756] = "Use: Combine 6 Azora Apprentice Notes to create a new engraving recipe."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[203784] = "Use: Combine with 3 other pieces to make the full map."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[203785] = "Use: Combine with 3 other pieces to make the full map."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[203786] = "Use: Combine with 3 other pieces to make the full map."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[203787] = "Use: Combine with 3 other pieces to make the full map."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[203960] = "Use: Combine 6 Azora Apprentice Notes to create a new engraving recipe."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[203961] = "Use: Combine 6 Azora Apprentice Notes to create a new engraving recipe."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[203962] = "Use: Combine 6 Azora Apprentice Notes to create a new engraving recipe."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[203990] = "Engrave your gloves with the Mutilate rune:\n\n\nInstantly attacks with both weapons for 95% weapon damage plus an additional 97 with each weapon.  Damage is increased by 20% against Poisoned targets.  Awards 2 combo points.\n\nMutilate benefits from all talents and effects that trigger from or modify Backstab unless otherwise specified."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[203991] = "Engrave your chest or robe with the Quick Draw rune:\n\n\nDraw your ranged weapon and fire a quick shot at an enemy, causing normal ranged weapon damage and reducing the target's movement speed by 50% for 6 sec. Awards 1 combo point.\n\nQuick Draw benefits from all talents and effects that trigger from or modify Sinister Strike."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[203993] = "Engrave your chest or robe with the Slaughter from the Shadows rune:\n\n\nReduces the Energy cost of your Backstab and Ambush abilities by 30, and increases the damage they deal to non-player controlled targets by 70%. Does not apply to abilities learned from other runes."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[203994] = "Engrave your chest or robe with the Deadly Brew rune:\n\n\nGrants several improvements to your poisons:\n\nWhen you inflict any other poison on a target, you also inflict Deadly Poison.\n\nIf your weapon does not have a poison applied, it has a chance to trigger Instant Poison as if Instant Poison were applied.\n\nDeadly Poison and Instant Poison now gain increased damage from your Attack Power.\n\nYour Deadly Poison can now be active on targets affected by another Rogue's Deadly Poison."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[204174] = "Engrave your pants with the Between the Eyes rune:\n\n\nRanged Finishing move that causes damage per combo point, increased by Attack Power, and Stuns the target:\n\n   1 point:   148 to 226 damage, 1 sec Stun\n   2 points: 238 to 364 damage, 2 sec Stun\n   3 points: 329 to 503 damage, 3 sec Stun\n   4 points: 420 to 641 damage, 4 sec Stun\n   5 points: 510 to 780 damage, 5 sec Stun\n\nCooldown shared with Kidney Shot."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[204441] = "Engrave your chest with the Blood Frenzy rune:\n\n\nRend can now be used in Berserker stance, Rend's damage is increased by 100%, and Rend deals additional damage equal to 4% of your Attack Power each time it deals damage."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[204688] = "Use: Combine with 2 other pieces to make the full rune."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[204689] = "Use: Combine with 2 other pieces to make the full rune."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[204690] = "Use: Combine with 2 other pieces to make the full rune."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[204703] = "Engrave your gloves with the Devastate rune:\n\n\nWhile you are in Defensive Stance and have a shield equipped, Sunder Armor also deals damage equal to 150% of your equipped weapon's damage per second, increased by 15% per application of Sunder Armor already on the target. Devastate damage deals a high amount of threat while you are in Defensive Stance."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[204716] = "Engrave your pants with the Frenzied Assault rune:\n\n\nWhile wielding 2-handed weapons, your attack speed is increased by 40% and your successful melee hits generate 2 additional Rage, or 4 additional Rage if they are critical hits."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[204795] = "Engrave your gloves with the Shadowstrike rune:\n\n\nTeleport behind your target and strike, causing 150% weapon damage to the target.  Must be stealthed.  Awards 1 combo point."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[204806] = "Engrave your gloves with the Victory Rush rune:\n\n\nInstantly attack the target causing 254 damage and healing you for 30% of your maximum health.  Only useable within 20 sec after you kill an enemy that yields experience or honor."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[204807] = "Chance on hit: Blasts all enemies in front of you with pressurized water.\nEquip: Improves your chance to hit with all spells and attacks by 1%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[204809] = "Engrave your pants with the Furious Thunder rune:\n\n\nThunder Clap now increases the time between attacks by an additional 6%, can be used in any stance, deals 100% increased damage, and deals 75% increased threat."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[204864] = "Use: Combine 6 Azora Apprentice Notes to create a new engraving recipe."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[204905] = "Use: Summon Soboz"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[204912] = "Engrave your pants with the Demonic Grace rune:\n\n\nSurge with fel energy, increasing your pet's and your own dodge chance by 20%, and your chance to critically strike with all attacks by 20%. Lasts 6 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[205022] = "Engrave your cloak with the Soul Siphon rune:\n\n\nCauses your Drain Soul to to deal damage 3 times faster and increases the amount drained by your Drain Life and Drain Soul spells by an additional 6% for each of your Warlock Shadow effects afflicting the target, up to a maximum of 18% additional effect. When Drain Soul is cast on a target below 20% health, it instead gains 50% per effect, up to a maximum of 150%. In addition, your Drain Soul can now trigger your Nightfall talent."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[205182] = "Use: Offer your blood to power the artifact."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[205215] = "Engrave your chest or robe with the Demonic Tactics rune:\n\n\nIncreases the melee and spell critical strike chance of you and your pet by 10%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[205218] = "Engrave your cloak with the Soul Siphon rune:\n\n\nCauses your Drain Soul to to deal damage 3 times faster and increases the amount drained by your Drain Life and Drain Soul spells by an additional 6% for each of your Warlock Shadow effects afflicting the target, up to a maximum of 18% additional effect. When Drain Soul is cast on a target below 20% health, it instead gains 50% per effect, up to a maximum of 150%. In addition, your Drain Soul can now trigger your Nightfall talent."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[205228] = "Engrave your gloves with the Chaos Bolt rune:\n\n\nSends a bolt of chaotic fire at the enemy, dealing 874 to 1099 Chaos damage.  Chaos Bolt always hits, cannot be resisted, and its knowledge causes all your Fire spells to pierce through absorption effects. Chaos Bolt gains a high chance to be resisted when used against monsters 4 or more levels above your level."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[205230] = "Engrave your gloves with the Haunt rune:\n\n\nUnleash a ghostly soul on an enemy, dealing 424 to 495 damage, and increasing all Shadow damage over time you deal to that target by 40% for 15 sec. When the Haunt ends or is dispelled, you will be healed for all the damage it dealt to your target."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[205420] = "Engrave your gloves with the Crusader Strike rune:\n\n\nAn instant strike that causes 75% weapon damage as Holy and regenerates 5% of your maximum mana. The duration of all Judgement effects on the target is refreshed to 30 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[205683] = "Engrave your pants with the Rebuke\n rune:\n\n\nInterrupts spellcasting and prevents any spell in that school from being cast for 3 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[205685] = "Engrave your chest with the Aegis rune:\n\n\nIncreases your block value by 30% and modifies your Redoubt talent. Redoubt now also has a 10% chance to trigger from any melee or ranged attack against you, and always triggers when you deal a melee critical strike. In addition, your Reckoning talent gains a 2% chance per talent point to trigger from any melee or ranged attack against you."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[205897] = "Engrave your cloak with the Divine Light rune:\n\n\nHeals a friendly target for 3797 to 4052. 50% of any excess healing on the target is converted into an absorption shield that lasts 15 sec. Multiple casts of Divine Light do not accumulate this shield.\n\nDivine Light benefits from all talents and effects that trigger from or modify Holy Light."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[205905] = "Engrave your chest or robe with the Twisted Faith rune:\n\n\nMind Flay and Mind Blast deal 50% increased damage to targets afflicted with your Shadow Word: Pain.\nUse: Focus on the Memory to learn a new spell.  Requires a mind cleared by meditating on the spiritual mysteries of Azeroth."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[205932] = "Engrave your gloves with the Shadow Word: Death rune:\n\n\nA word of dark binding that inflicts 626 to 723 Shadow damage to the target.  If the target is not killed by Shadow Word: Death, the caster takes damage equal to 50% of the damage attempted against the target.\nUse: Focus on the Prophecy to learn a new spell.  Requires a mind focused by meditating on two spiritual mysteries of Azeroth."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[205940] = "Engrave your boots with the Void Plague rune:\n\n\nAfflicts the target with a disease that causes 1510 Shadow damage over 18 sec.\nUse: Focus on the Memory to learn a new spell.  Requires a mind cleared by meditating on the spiritual mysteries of Azeroth."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[205942] = "Engrave your pants with the Prayer of Mending rune:\n\n\nPlaces a spell on the target that heals them for 498 the next time they take damage or receive healing.  When the heal occurs, Prayer of Mending jumps to a party or raid member within 20 yards.  Jumps up to 5 times and lasts 30 sec after each jump.  This spell can only be placed on one target at a time."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[205943] = "Engrave your pants with the Homunculi rune:\n\n\nBreak off splinters of your soul to animate 3 miniature copies of yourself that attempt to attack your current target with a mace, sword, and axe, reducing the attack speed, attack power, and armor respectively of any target they hit.\nUse: Focus on the Prophecy to learn a new spell.  Requires a mind focused by meditating on two spiritual mysteries of Azeroth."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[205944] = "Engrave your pants with the Prayer of Mending rune:\n\n\nPlaces a spell on the target that heals them for 498 the next time they take damage or receive healing.  When the heal occurs, Prayer of Mending jumps to a party or raid member within 20 yards.  Jumps up to 5 times and lasts 30 sec after each jump.  This spell can only be placed on one target at a time."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[205945] = "Engrave your pants with the Shared Pain rune:\n\n\nYour Shadow Word: Pain now also afflicts up to 2 additional nearby targets within 15 yards.\nUse: Focus on the Memory to learn a new spell.  Requires a mind cleared by meditating on the spiritual mysteries of Azeroth."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[205946] = "Engrave your boots with the Pain Suppression rune:\n\n\nInstantly reduces all damage taken by a friendly target by 40% and increases resistance to Dispel mechanics by 65% for 8 sec.\nUse: Focus on the Memory to learn a new spell.  Requires a mind cleared by meditating on the spiritual mysteries of Azeroth."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[205947] = "Engrave your pants with the Homunculi rune:\n\n\nBreak off splinters of your soul to animate 3 miniature copies of yourself that attempt to attack your current target with a mace, sword, and axe, reducing the attack speed, attack power, and armor respectively of any target they hit.\nUse: Focus on the Prophecy to learn a new spell.  Requires a mind focused by meditating on two spiritual mysteries of Azeroth."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[205948] = "Engrave your cloak with the Vampiric Touch rune:\n\n\nApplies your Vampiric Embrace talent to your target, causes 657 Shadow damage over 15 sec to your target, and causes all party members to gain mana equal to 2% of any Shadow spell damage you deal to the target."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[205949] = "Engrave your gloves with the Circle of Healing rune:\n\n\nHeals all of target player's party members within 43 yards of target player for 1176 to 1270."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[205950] = "Engrave your gloves with the Mind Sear rune:\n\n\nCauses an explosion of shadow magic damaging the enemy target and other nearby enemies, causing 147 to 162 Shadow damage every 1 sec for 6 sec to all enemies within 10 yards of the target."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[205951] = "Engrave your gloves with the Penance rune:\n\n\nLaunches a volley of holy light at the target, causing 256 Holy damage to an enemy, or 973 healing to an ally, instantly and every 1 sec for 2 sec.\nUse: Focus on the Memory to learn a new spell.  Requires a mind cleared by meditating on the spiritual mysteries of Azeroth."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[205952] = "Engrave your pants with the Black and White rune:\n\n\nYour healing spells increase all damage from your damage spells by 10% for 15 sec or until you cast a damage spell, and your damage spells increase all healing done by your healing spells by 10% for 15 sec or until you cast a healing spell. Both effects stack up to 5 times.\nUse: Focus on the Memory to learn a new spell.  Requires a mind cleared by meditating on the spiritual mysteries of Azeroth."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[205953] = "Engrave your belt with the Mind Spike rune:\n\n\nBlasts the target for 253 to 291 Shadowfrost damage, and increases the critical strike chance of your next Mind Blast on the target by 30%, stacking up to 3 times.\nUse: Focus on the Prophecy to learn a new spell.  Requires a mind focused by meditating on two spiritual mysteries of Azeroth."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[205961] = "Use: Place as bait near a mountain cat's dwelling."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[205979] = "Engrave your pants with the Flanking Strike rune:\n\n\nYou and your pet deal simultaneous instant 100% melee damage. Afterward, you deal 8% increased damage for 10 sec, stacking up to 3 times. Your pet's Basic attacks have a 50% chance to reset the cooldown on Flanking Strike."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[205995] = "Use: Your Tame Beast ability also works on prairie dogs (as companion pet) (10 Mins Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[206032] = "Engrave your gloves with the Carve rune:\n\n\nA sweeping attack that strikes all enemies in front of you with your melee weapons for 65% weapon damage. Your primary target takes 50% increased damage."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[206155] = "Engrave your chest or robe with the Master Marksman rune:\n\n\nIncreases your critical strike chance by 5%, and reduces the Mana cost of all your Shot abilities by 25%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[206168] = "Engrave your gloves with the Chimera Shot rune:\n\n\nYou deal 135% weapon damage, refreshing the current Sting on your target and triggering an effect:\n\nSerpent Sting - Instantly deals 59% of the damage done by your Serpent Sting.\n\nViper Sting - Instantly restores mana to you equal to 60% of the total amount drained by your Viper Sting.\n\nScorpid Sting - Attempts to Disarm the target for 10 sec. This effect cannot occur more than once per 1 minute."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[206169] = "Engrave your gloves with the Explosive Shot rune:\n\n\nYou fire an explosive charge into the enemy target, dealing 81-120 Fire damage to all enemies within 8 yards. The charge will deal damage again every second for an additional 2 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[206176] = "Use: Grind 8 Windfury Cones together to create a venomous weapon salve.  In theory."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[206177] = "Use: Restores 58 health over 18 sec.  Must remain seated while eating.  If you spend at least 10 seconds eating you will become well fed and gain 2 Stamina and Spirit for 15 min. (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[206264] = "Engrave your pants with the Inspiration Exemplar rune:\n\n\nYour inspiring presence periodically dispels Fear and Sleep effects on nearby party members."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[206344] = "Use: Attempt to fillet a Raw Brilliant Smallfish."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[206376] = "Engrave your chest or robe with the Shield Mastery rune:\n\n\nEach time you Block, you regenerate mana equal to 8% of your maximum mana and you gain Armor equal to 30% of your shield's armor value, stacking up to 5 times. You also always gain 10% increased chance to Block and 15% increased Block value.\n\nIn addition, each time you use a Shock ability, you gain 4 Spell Damage for each point of your defense skill beyond 300. Lasts 15 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[206381] = "Engrave your chest or robe with the Overload rune:\n\n\nGives your Lightning Bolt, Chain Lightning, Chain Heal, Healing Wave, and Lava Burst spells a 60% chance to cast a second, similar spell on the same target at no additional cost that causes half damage or healing and no threat."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[206382] = "Engrave your gloves with the Water Shield rune:\n\n\nThe caster is surrounded by 3 globes of water, granting 1% of your maximum mana per 5 sec.  When a spell, melee or ranged attack hits the caster, 4% of maximum mana is restored to the caster. This expends one water globe.  Only one globe will activate every few seconds.  Lasts 10 min.  Only one Elemental Shield can be active on the Shaman at any one time."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[206383] = "Engrave your pants with the Earth Shield rune:\n\n\nProtects the target with an earthen shield, reducing casting or channeling time lost when damaged by 30%  and causing attacks to heal the shielded target for 157.  This effect can only occur once every few seconds.  9 charges. Lasts 10 min.  Earth Shield can only be placed on one target at a time."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[206384] = "Engrave your gloves with the Astral Shift rune:\n\n\nShift partly into the Astral plane, reducing all damage taken by 40% for 8 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[206385] = "Engrave your pants with the Way of Earth rune:\n\n\nWhile Rockbiter Weapon is active on your main hand weapon and you have a shield equipped, you deal 65% increased threat, gain 25% increased health, take 10% reduced damage, gain 6% reduced chance to be critically hit by melee attacks, and Earth Shock taunts targets to attack you and has a separate cooldown from other Shock spells but has its range reduced to melee range. However, the range of your Lightning Bolt, Chain Lightning, Chain Heal, Healing Wave, and Lava Burst spells is reduced by 20 yards."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[206386] = "Engrave your chest or robe with the Shield Mastery rune:\n\n\nEach time you Block, you regenerate mana equal to 8% of your maximum mana and you gain Armor equal to 30% of your shield's armor value, stacking up to 5 times. You also always gain 10% increased chance to Block and 15% increased Block value.\n\nIn addition, each time you use a Shock ability, you gain 4 Spell Damage for each point of your defense skill beyond 300. Lasts 15 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[206387] = "Engrave your gloves with the Lava Burst rune:\n\n\nYou hurl molten lava at the target, dealing 814 to 1042 Fire damage. If your Flame Shock is on the target, Lava Burst will deal a critical strike."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[206388] = "Engrave your gloves with the Molten Blast rune:\n\n\nBlast up to 10 enemies in a cone in front of you for 156 to 216 Fire damage. This ability generates a high amount of threat. Flame Shock periodic damage has a 10% chance to reset the cooldown on Molten Blast."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[206389] = "Engrave your belt with the Fire Nova rune:\n\n\nYour Fire Nova Totem spell is replaced with Fire Nova, which causes your current Fire totem to emit damage at its location."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[206390] = "Engrave your gloves with the Water Shield rune:\n\n\nThe caster is surrounded by 3 globes of water, granting 1% of your maximum mana per 5 sec.  When a spell, melee or ranged attack hits the caster, 4% of maximum mana is restored to the caster. This expends one water globe.  Only one globe will activate every few seconds.  Lasts 10 min.  Only one Elemental Shield can be active on the Shaman at any one time."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[206391] = "Engrave your bracers with the Riptide\n rune:\n\n\nHeals a friendly target for 447 to 481 and another 631 over 15 sec.  Your Chain Heals cast on that primary target within 15 sec will increase the amount of the Chain Heal by 25%. This spell also triggers Ancestral Awakening."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[206466] = "Use: Awaken a spirit of the plains"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[206469] = "Use: Combine 3 Prairie Flowers to make a crown."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[206954] = "Engrave your gloves with the Mangle rune:\n\n\nMangle the target for 160% normal damage and cause the target to take 30% additional damage from Bleed effects and Shred for 1 min. This ability benefits from and triggers all effects associated with Claw and Maul.\n\nHitting a target with Mangle (Bear) also grants you 4 Attack Power for each point of your defense skill beyond 300. Lasts 15 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[206963] = "Engrave your chest or robe with the Living Seed rune:\n\n\nWhen you critically heal your target with any non-periodic healing spell you plant a Living Seed on the target for 50% of the amount healed. The Living Seed will bloom the next time the target takes damage or receives non-periodic healing. Lasts 15 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[206970] = "Engrave your pants with the Lifebloom rune:\n\nReduces the global cooldown on your  Rejuvenation and Lifebloom abilities by 0.5 sec and you gain the Lifebloom ability:\n\n\nHeals the target for 190 over 7 sec.  When Lifebloom completes its duration or is dispelled, the target instantly heals for 387 and the Druid regains half the cost of the spell.  This effect can stack up to 3 times on the same target."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[206985] = "Engrave your boots with the Spirit of the Alpha rune:\n\n\nInfuses the target with the spirit of an alpha wolf, increasing all threat generated by the target by 45% for 30 min. Limit 1 target. If cast on a target other than self, the Shaman also gains Loyal Beta, increasing Physical damage done by 5% and reducing all threat generated by 30% for 30 min. A target cannot have both Spirit of the Alpha and Loyal Beta at the same time."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[206989] = "Engrave your gloves with the Sunfire rune:\n\n\nBurns the enemy for 200 to 233 Nature damage and then an additional 410 Nature damage over 12 sec.\n\nIn addition, while in Bear Form, Cat Form, or Dire Bear Form, your Moonfire is replaced with Sunfire (Bear) or Sunfire (Cat). This spell benefits from and triggers all effects associated with Moonfire.\n\nSunfire (Bear)\nBurns the enemy for 194 to 227 Nature damage and then an additional 388 Nature damage over 12 sec.\n\nSunfire (Cat)\nBurns the enemy for 194 to 227 Nature damage and then an additional 388 Nature damage over 12 sec. Awards 1 combo point."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[206992] = "Engrave your gloves with the Skull Bash rune:\n\n\nCharge to a target within 13 yards and bash the target's skull, interrupting spellcasting and preventing any spell in that school from being cast for 2 sec. Shares a cooldown with Feral Charge."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[207106] = "Use: Combine with 3 other pieces to make the full map."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[207107] = "Use: Combine with 3 other pieces to make the full map."
