WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[208608] = "Use: Place as bait inside a great bear's den"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[208609] = "Use: Combine 3 Glade Flowers to make a crown."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[208687] = "Engrave your pants with the Lacerate\n rune:\n\n\nLacerates the enemy target, making them bleed for 149 damage over 15 sec plus 20% weapon damage per existing application of Lacerate on the target. Causes a high amount of threat. This effect stacks up to 5 times on the same target."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[208689] = "Engrave your pants with the Savage Roar rune:\n\n\nFinishing move that increases physical damage done by 30% while in Cat Form.  Lasts longer per combo point:\n   1 point  : 14 seconds\n   2 points: 19 seconds\n   3 points: 24 seconds\n   4 points: 29 seconds\n   5 points: 34 seconds"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[208701] = "Engrave your chest or robe with the Beast Mastery rune:\n\n\nYour pet's damage and health are increased by 15%, and its Focus regeneration by 50%. In addition, your pet's Growl now also Taunts the target to attack it for 3 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[208741] = "Engrave your helm with the Endless Rage rune:\n\n\nYou generate 25% more Rage from all damage you deal."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[208744] = "Engrave your gloves with the Shadow Bolt Volley rune:\n\n\nYour Shadow Bolt now strikes up to 5 targets within a chain distance of 10 yards, but for 30% reduced damage."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[208750] = "Engrave your chest or robe with the Master Channeler rune:\n\n\nYour Drain Life is no longer channeled, lasts 15 sec with a 15 sec cooldown, costs 100% more mana, and heals you for 50% more each time it deals damage."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[208753] = "Engrave your chest or robe with the Regeneration rune:\n\n\nHeals the target for 1110 health over 3 sec and applies Temporal Beacon for 30 sec. \n\nTemporal Beacon\n\nRecords the subject's space-time position. 70% of all Arcane damage done by the caster will be converted to chronomantic healing on each of the caster's current Temporal Beacon targets. This healing is reduced by 50% on self, and also reduced by 80% when damage is done by Arcane spells that damage multiple targets."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[208754] = "Use: Decipher the spell notes with a Comprehension Charm to learn a new Engraving spell."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[208758] = "Engrave your pants with the Way of Earth rune:\n\n\nWhile Rockbiter Weapon is active on your main hand weapon and you have a shield equipped, you deal 65% increased threat, gain 25% increased health, take 10% reduced damage, gain 6% reduced chance to be critically hit by melee attacks, and Earth Shock taunts targets to attack you and has a separate cooldown from other Shock spells but has its range reduced to melee range. However, the range of your Lightning Bolt, Chain Lightning, Chain Heal, Healing Wave, and Lava Burst spells is reduced by 20 yards."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[208760] = "Use: Awaken a spirit of the plains"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[208764] = "Engrave your belt with the Mind Spike rune:\n\n\nBlasts the target for 253 to 291 Shadowfrost damage, and increases the critical strike chance of your next Mind Blast on the target by 30%, stacking up to 3 times."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[208767] = "Engrave your pants with the Prayer of Mending rune:\n\n\nPlaces a spell on the target that heals them for 498 the next time they take damage or receive healing.  When the heal occurs, Prayer of Mending jumps to a party or raid member within 20 yards.  Jumps up to 5 times and lasts 30 sec after each jump.  This spell can only be placed on one target at a time."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[208771] = "Engrave your pants with the Blade Dance rune:\n\n\nFinishing move that increases your Parry chance by 10% and grants 4 Attack Power for each point of your defense skill beyond 300. Lasts longer per combo point:\n\n   1 point  : 14 seconds\n   2 points: 18 seconds\n   3 points: 22 seconds\n   4 points: 26 seconds\n   5 points: 30 seconds"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[208772] = "Engrave your gloves with the Saber Slash rune:\n\n\nViciously slash an enemy for 100% weapon damage, and cause the target to bleed for 28 damage every 2 sec for 12 sec, stacking up to 3 times. Each stack also increases damage done by your Saber Slash and Sinister Strike by 50%. Awards 1 combo point.\n\nSaber Slash benefits from all talents and effects that trigger from or modify Sinister Strike."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[208773] = "Use: Throw harpoon at target (40 yd. range)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[208777] = "Engrave your pants with the Sniper Training rune:\n\n\nYour Shot abilities gain 2% increased critical strike chance while you have not moved for the last 2 sec, stacking every sec up to 5 times. At 2 or more stacks, your Aimed Shot becomes instant. While moving, you will lose 1 stack per sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[208778] = "Engrave your gloves with the Quick Strike rune:\n\n\nA reckless instant melee attack with your two-handed weapon dealing 169 to 225 physical damage. This ability benefits from and triggers all effects associated with Heroic Strike."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[208799] = "Engrave your gloves with the Living Bomb rune:\n\n\nThe target becomes a Living Bomb, taking 631 Fire damage over 12 sec.  After 12 sec or when the spell is dispelled, the target explodes dealing 317 Fire damage to all enemies within 10 yards.\n\nLiving Bomb benefits from all talents and effects that trigger from or modify Scorch."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[208823] = "Use: Toss into a nearby well to make a wish"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[208828] = "Engrave your belt with the Mind Spike rune:\n\n\nBlasts the target for 253 to 291 Shadowfrost damage, and increases the critical strike chance of your next Mind Blast on the target by 30%, stacking up to 3 times.\nUse: Focus on the Memory to learn a new spell.  Requires a mind cleared by meditating on the spiritual mysteries of Azeroth."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[208843] = "Use: Challenge a Tauren to a duel"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[208849] = "Engrave your chest with the Hallowed Ground rune:\n\n\nYour Consecration now also heals party members within its area for 200% of Consecration's damage value."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[208851] = "Engrave your gloves with the Hand of Reckoning rune:\n\n\nTaunts the target to attack you, but has no effect if the target is already attacking you.\n\nWhile you know this ability, the threat bonus from Righteous Fury is increased to 80% and Righteous Fury causes you to gain mana when healed by others equal to 25% of the amount healed. Additionally, while Righteous Fury is active, damage which takes you below 35% health is reduced by 20%. Righteous Fury will remain active until cancelled."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[208853] = "Engrave your boots with the Brain Freeze rune:\n\n\nYour Frost damage spells with chilling effects have a 20% chance to cause your next Fireball, Spellfrost Bolt, Balefire Bolt, or Frostfire Bolt spell to be instant cast and cost no mana."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[208854] = "Use: Decipher the spell notes with a Comprehension Charm to learn a new Engraving spell."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[208855] = "Use: Feed chum to target."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[209027] = "Use: Feed treat to target."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[209028] = "Use: Decipher the spell notes with a Comprehension Charm to learn a new Engraving spell."
