WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[221468] = "Equip: When struck by a harmful spell, the caster of that spell has a 5% chance to be silenced for 3 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[221469] = "Use: Hurls the spear at the target, immobilizing them for 5 sec. (5 Mins Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[221473] = "Engrave your helm with the Vigilance rune:\n\n\nFocus your protective gaze on a party or raid member, reducing their damage taken by 3% and transferring 10% of the threat they cause to you.  In addition, each time they are hit by an attack your Taunt cooldown is refreshed.  Lasts 30 min.  This effect can only be on one target at a time."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[221474] = "Use: Poisons all enemies in an 8 yard radius around the caster.  Victims of the poison suffer 50 Nature damage every 5 sec for 45 sec. (10 Mins Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[221480] = "Engrave your bracers with the Molten Armor rune:\n\n\nCauses 17 Fire damage when hit, increases your spell critical strike chance by 5%, and reduces the chance you are critically hit by 5%.  Only one type of Armor spell can be active on the Mage at any time.  Lasts 30 min."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[221481] = "Engrave your bracers with the Void Zone rune:\n\n\nSummons a void zone in the target area that deals 101 Shadow damage to enemies that stand within it every second for 10 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[221482] = "Engrave your bracers with the Unstable Affliction rune:\n\n\nShadow energy slowly destroys the target, causing 2395 damage over 18 sec. In addition, if the Unstable Affliction is dispelled it will cause 906 damage to the dispeller and silence them for 5 sec. Only one Unstable Affliction or Immolate per Warlock can be active on any one target."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[221483] = "Engrave your helm with the Burn rune:\n\n\nYour Flame Shock now strikes up to 5 targets, gains 6 sec increased duration, and deals 100% increased damage. In addition, while you have Flametongue Weapon imbued on your main hand equipped weapon, you gain increased spell damage equal to 150% of your Intellect."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[221484] = "Use: Hexes yourself to be a bit harder to detect in Sunken Temple. (3 Secs Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[221487] = "Engrave your helm with the Advanced Warding rune:\n\n\nYour Mana Shield, Frost Ward, and Fire Ward spells can now be cast on any friendly target and absorb 100% increased damage, with Mana Shield consuming 50% less mana per damage absorbed. Additionally, your Remove Lesser Curse is replaced with Remove Greater Curse.\n\n\nRemoves 1 Curse and 1 harmful Magic effect from a friendly target."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[221488] = "Engrave your helm with the Divine Aegis rune:\n\n\nCritical heals create a protective shield on the target, absorbing 30% of the amount healed. Lasts 12 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[221489] = "Engrave your helm with the Vengeance rune:\n\n\nWhen activated, this ability temporarily grants you a 30% increase to your maximum health for 20 sec. After the effect expires, the health is lost. Additionally, while in Metamorphosis, Vengeance causes your wings to slow your falling speed."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[221490] = "Engrave your bracers with the Riptide\n rune:\n\n\nHeals a friendly target for 447 to 481 and another 631 over 15 sec.  Your Chain Heals cast on that primary target within 15 sec will increase the amount of the Chain Heal by 25%. This spell also triggers Ancestral Awakening."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[221497] = "Use: Opens Old Chest (1 Sec Cooldown)"
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[221499] = "Engrave your bracers with the Summon Felguard rune:\n\n\nSummons a Felguard under the command of the Warlock.\n\nThe Felguard benefits from all talents and effects that trigger from or benefit any of your other Demon minions."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[221510] = "Engrave your bracers with the Sword and Board rune:\n\n\nWhen your Devastate and Revenge abilities deal damage they have a 30% chance of refreshing the cooldown of your Shield Slam ability and reducing its Rage cost by 100% for 5 sec."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[221511] = "Engrave your helm with the Shield Mastery rune:\n\n\nIncreases all physical damage you deal by 10% while you have a shield equipped, and reduces the duration of all Disarm effects used against you by 50%.  This does not stack with other Disarm duration reducing effects."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[221512] = "Engrave your bracers with the Cut to the Chase rune:\n\n\nYour Eviscerate and Envenom abilities refresh either your Slice and Dice or your Blade Dance duration to its 5 combo point maximum. If both are active, only the one with shortest remaining duration will be refreshed."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[221513] = "Engrave your helm with the Combat Potency rune:\n\n\nYou have a 20% chance to gain 15 Energy every time you deal melee damage with your off-hand weapon."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[221514] = "Engrave your helm with the Lock and Load rune:\n\n\nEach time you place a trap, your next Shot (except Scatter Shot) ability within 20 sec costs no mana and does not incur a cooldown."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[221515] = "Engrave your bracers with the T.N.T. rune:\n\n\nIncreases the damage done by Explosive Shot and all your damaging traps by 10%. Additionally, the initial damage of Explosive Trap and the total periodic damage of your Immolation Trap are increased by 25% of your melee or ranged Attack Power."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[221516] = "Engrave your bracers with the Improved Frenzied Regeneration rune:\n\n\nYour Frenzied Regeneration can now be used in all forms except Moonkin Form or while not shapeshifted. It now converts your active resource into health every second for 10 sec. Up to 10 Rage, 10 Energy, or 20% base Mana is converted per second into up to 10% health."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[221517] = "Engrave your helm with the Gore rune:\n\n\nStriking a target with Lacerate, Swipe, or Maul has a 15% chance to reset the cooldown on Mangle (Bear) and grant 10  Rage. Striking a target with Mangle (Cat) or Shred has a 15% chance to reset the cooldown on Tiger's Fury."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[221518] = "Equip: Improves your chance to get a critical strike with all spells and attacks by 1%."
WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[221547] = "Use: A cipher is needed to understand the Warlock's notes. Who knows what magic it contains?"
