WordHunterWoW_ENDesc_Item[223147] = "Engrave your bracers with the Balefire Bolt rune:\n\n\nUnleash a reality-distorting burst of raw magic at your enemy, dealing 530 to 773 Chimeric damage.\n\nIncreasing your Balefire Bolt and Pyroblast damage by 25%, decreasing your Spirit by 20%, and stacking up to 5 times for 30 sec. If your Spirit reaches 0, you die.\n\nThis spell will be checked against the lower of the target's Arcane, Fire, and Frost resists."
